		mes "I was too weak to protect";
		mes "my comrades. Too weak...";
		mes "When I came back to my";
		mes "senses, they were all...";
		next;
		emotion ET_THINK;
		mes "[The Wanderer]";
		mes "I'm not sure what";
		mes "happened. There was";
		mes "blood coming into my eyes...";
